<title>UK: UK's Logica yr pre-tax profits seen rising.</title>
<headline>UK's Logica yr pre-tax profits seen rising.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British software company Logica Plc said on Thursday its pre-tax profits for the year to June 30, 1997 was expected to be 28.1 million stg, up from 24.7 million stg in the previous year.</p>
<p>The directors intend to recommend a final dividend of 5.8 pence a share making it a total of 9.4 pence per share, up from 7.8 pence in the previous year.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
